{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af58cb99aa9dc5a833d5a3a","chatId":"b379efcb387e4af1a2b55d62e4c3d948","sessionId":null,"userId":95240,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[B]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[B]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1084,"promptTokens":2179,"completionTokens":67,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:54:01"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.03732688734412946,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58cb99aa9dc5a833d5a39","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794477241537,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:54:01","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af58cb99aa9dc5a833d5a39","chatId":"b379efcb387e4af1a2b55d62e4c3d948","sessionId":null,"userId":95240,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n晴晴、大鹏和光头强都是同一个频道的主播。他们经常在同一个节目中出现，但私下里相处都很少。一天，节目录制结束后，大鹏看见晴晴正准备离开，他连忙走过去想和她说两句话。这时，光头强也走了过来。大鹏看到光头强，便笑了笑，对晴晴说：“我还有件事要处理，我先走啦。”然后转身离去。晴晴看着大鹏的背影，脸色微红。\n\n[问题]\n大鹏为什么看到光头强后，选择离开？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 大鹏并不喜欢晴晴，只是礼貌性地过去打了个招呼。\nB. 大鹏不想光头强知道他和晴晴说的话。\nC. 大鹏是一个比较内向的人，不喜欢和别人多交流。\nD. 大鹏真的有另一件事需要处理。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.03732688734412946,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58cb99aa9dc5a833d5a3a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794477241534,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:54:01","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"7cfd14ab02f9446089c01412335563b2"}